		{
			"id": "eZTDJj_HIRR00JTk4",
			"description": "Plague Knife",
			"local_notes": "Sized for a gauntleted Astartes hand, like the Astartes combat knife.\n\nLore: Death Guard Plague Marines carry blades that are crusted with filth and rot, poisoned with the diseases of Nurgle. A scratch from one carries a plague (Codex: Death Guard and Black Library Death Guard fiction).\n\nDesign: The thrust and swing lines are the Astartes combat knife's, copied: thr+1 imp and sw+1 cut, reach C,1, parry 0, ST 11, Shortsword, 4 lb. The follow-up is the Chaos anchor, a 2d tox line whose usage contains \"follow-up\" so the simulator applies it after a penetrating hit. Cost $600 over the combat knife's $200 for the poison. TL 2 as the knife: the blade is ordinary, the corruption is not.",
